# Fillet where a cone meets a cylinder (roadmap 22.2): a frustum turned
# on a shaft; with the arc of the circle where they meet picked, Fillet
# Edges rounds the circle by a torus, both faces cut back along their
# tangent circles. Check Solid finds it sound.
file $testdata/ui/fillet_cone_shaft.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view default
move 295 245
down L 295 245
up L 295 245
menu Features|Fillet Edges
tw
answer ok
